-- l4 batch over a MAYBE input with no default, followed by another input
-- (T3c's MAYBE paragraph, specs/todo/TYPICALLY-ONE-BEHAVIOUR-SPEC.md). An
-- empty CSV cell is a left-out input: NOTHING while presumption is soft,
-- missing while it is hard.

@export Premium
GIVEN premium IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      flag IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
`premium due` MEANS
  CONSIDER premium
    WHEN JUST p THEN p
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0
